&lt;p&gt;    I&apos;m reporter of &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2999&quot; title=&quot;Cannot create shell interpreter without timeout property&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-2999&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-2999&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. IMO it&apos;s invalid solution. With this code, it cannot run without timeout. What I intend with no timeout option is I will approve waiting command execution forever.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
