&lt;p&gt;    @toughrogrammer  What I think you are looking for is &quot;INFINITE_TIMEOUT = -1L&quot;, in which case I would recommend instead of removing this &quot;shell.command.timeout.millisecs&quot; parameter pass &quot;-1&quot; in the Zeppelin interpreter setting. Any thoughts?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
